 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Roughly one bag per arm and leg, and a small bag that you hold on to something solid between bike pedal strokes. A basket only works if it' very small and you have a very slow bike. Most people buy a bike with the space already there. Then look at the bikes that have the space for it and buy one of those. Not ideal, it hangs on the front wheel fore and aft, which puts a lot of strain on the wheel. A basket is much worse, as it puts weight right in the middle.",
